Package: hvtiR
Type: Package
Title: Install and Check the HVTI R Package Family
Version: 1.1.2
Date: 2026-09-03
Authors@R: person("John", "Ehrlinger", email = "john.ehrlinger@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Installs, updates and reports on the Cleveland Clinic Heart and
    Vascular Institute CORR group's family of R packages in a single step.
    Members are resolved from public GitHub repositories with 'pak', keeping
    installations aligned with the source where family releases land first.
    Provides a status table comparing installed versions and source commits
    against GitHub 'main', and a diagnostic report for environment problems.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    cli,
    jsonlite,
    utils
Suggests:
    curl,
    ggBoostedTrees,
    ggRandomForests,
    hvtiPlotR,
    knitr,
    pak,
    quarto,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
Remotes:
    ehrlinger/ggBoostedTrees,
    ehrlinger/ggRandomForests,
    ehrlinger/hvtiPlotR
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
